{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064561/block/singleImage/3271620/df/01M7RHEC5ASGXPJFFK57MQTYDB.jpg?updatedAt=1795049316\"/><figcaption>油麻地唐樓搗破毒品倉拘25歲男，檢50萬元氯胺酮等毒品。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>警方表示，深水埗警區特別職務隊人員經深入調查後，昨日(18日)在油麻地廟街進行打擊毒品行動。行動中，警方於一個懷疑被用作毒品倉庫的唐樓單位，檢獲約900克懷疑氯胺酮及約70克懷疑可卡因，毒品總市值約五十萬元。警方以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」拘捕一名25歲非華裔男子，他現正被扣留調查。警方重申，根據香港法例第134章《危險藥物條例》，任何人如販運危險藥物，一經定罪，最高可判處罰款500萬元及終身監禁，呼籲市民切勿以身試法。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064561/block/singleImage/3271622/df/01M7RHG8DP6NT2X2C1GBMAZZK0.jpg?updatedAt=1795049316\"/><figcaption>警方以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」拘捕一名25歲非華裔男子。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.206236+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.557680+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:14.305090+00:00","content_hash":"4dc14ae908aa697cae530db6f38adaf5c6c76b68e4f8c6139134309c9448b854","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.206236+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}